---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import CTAFooter from "../components/CTAFooter.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing — Vera AI"
  description="Simple pricing for Vera AI. Monthly and yearly plans, 3-day free trial, transparent metered usage. All prices in US dollars."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="pricing">
    <div class="pricing-inner">
      <header class="pricing-header">
        <div class="pricing-badge">Pricing</div>
        <h1>Simple, transparent pricing</h1>
        <p class="pricing-subtitle">
          One plan, two billing cadences. Try Vera free for 3 days — no
          credit card required to start. All prices in US dollars (USD).
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="plans">
        <article class="plan">
          <div class="plan-name">Pro — Monthly</div>
          <div class="plan-price">
            <span class="amount">$50</span>
            <span class="cadence">USD / month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="plan-tagline">
            Billed monthly. Cancel anytime — access continues until the end of
            your current billing period.
          </p>
          <ul class="plan-features">
            <li>Unlimited Slack, Linear, and GitHub delegations</li>
            <li>Dedicated, isolated tenant infrastructure</li>
            <li>5-stage engineering lifecycle (Research → Plan → Execute → Review → Triage)</li>
            <li>7-day conversation and execution log retention</li>
            <li>Email support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/onboarding" class="plan-cta">Create account →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan plan-highlight">
          <div class="plan-flag">Save $100</div>
          <div class="plan-name">Pro — Yearly</div>
          <div class="plan-price">
            <span class="amount">$500</span>
            <span class="cadence">USD / year</span>
          </div>
          <p class="plan-tagline">
            Billed once per year. Equivalent to ~$41.67/month — two months
            free compared to the monthly plan.
          </p>
          <ul class="plan-features">
            <li>Everything in Pro Monthly</li>
            <li>Two months free vs. monthly billing</li>
            <li>Priority email support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/onboarding" class="plan-cta">Create account →</a>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>What's included</h2>
        <p>
          Both plans include unlimited delegations to Vera across Slack,
          Linear, and GitHub, an isolated per-tenant compute environment, and
          access to every feature listed on the
          <a href="/" class="inline-link">product page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Token usage</h2>
        <p>
          Each plan includes a monthly allowance of LLM token usage that
          covers normal team workloads. Usage above the included allowance is
          billed as metered overage at cost — you'll see your current usage
          and the exact per-token rate in your
          <a href="/account/billing" class="inline-link">account dashboard</a>
          before any overage charge is applied.
        </p>
        {/*
          TODO: replace this paragraph with concrete numbers once finalized.
          Suggested format:
            - "Each plan includes N million tokens / month."
            - "Overage billed at $X per million input tokens, $Y per million output tokens."
          The dashboard already exposes per-turn token usage via account/billing.
        */}
        <p class="caveat">
          You can set a hard monthly spend cap in your account dashboard.
          Vera will pause new sessions once the cap is reached and resume on
          the next billing period.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Free trial</h2>
        <p>
          New workspaces get a <strong>3-day free trial</strong> of the Pro
          plan with no credit card required. At any point during the trial
          you can add a payment method to continue past day 3.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you don't add a payment method before the trial ends, your
          workspace is paused — your data is retained for 30 days so you can
          come back later without losing your install. After 30 days, paused
          workspaces are deleted.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Cancellation and refunds</h2>
        <p>
          You can cancel anytime from your
          <a href="/account/billing" class="inline-link">billing dashboard</a>.
          When you cancel, your subscription remains active through the end
          of your current billing period and is not renewed. You will not be
          charged again.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not pro-rate refunds for partial billing periods. If you
          believe you were charged in error, or if Vera was unavailable for an
          extended period, email
          <a href="mailto:billing@agent-vera.com">billing@agent-vera.com</a>
          and we'll review on a case-by-case basis.
        </p>
        <p>
          Full refund and cancellation terms are in our
          <a href="/terms" class="inline-link">Terms of Service</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="contact">
        <h2>Questions about pricing?</h2>
        <p>
          Email <a href="mailto:hello@agent-vera.com">hello@agent-vera.com</a>
          and we'll get back to you. For volume or enterprise pricing, ask
          about annual contracts.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <CTAFooter />
</Layout>

<style>
  .pricing {
    padding: 8rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .pricing-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pricing-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pricing-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.3);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pricing-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .plans {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .plan {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.15);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .plan-highlight {
    border: 2px solid var(--color-text);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .plan-flag {
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.75rem;
    right: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-text);
    color: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .plan-name {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .plan-price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .plan-price .amount {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .plan-price .cadence {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .plan-tagline {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .plan-features {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .plan-features li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .plan-features li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .plan-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-text);
    color: var(--color-bg) !important;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .plan-cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
    color: var(--color-bg) !important;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .section > p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section > p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .section a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .inline-link {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .caveat {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.2);
    background: rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.03);
    margin-top: 1rem !important;
  }

  .contact {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(13, 40, 24, 0.12);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .contact h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .contact p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .contact a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .pricing {
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    }

    .plans {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .plan {
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .plan-price .amount {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
